### Add user
POST http://localhost:8081/user/admin
content-type:application/json

{
  "login": "111",
  "name": "111",
  "password": "111"
}

### get token admin
GET http://localhost:8081/user/token?username=111&password=111

### Add admin authentification без аутентификации ошибка
