### Add admin
POST http://localhost:8081/user
content-type:application/json

{
  "login": "222",
  "name": "222",
  "password": "222"
}

### get token user
GET http://localhost:8081/user/token?username=222&password=222


### Add admin
GET http://localhost:8081/user/1
content-type:application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}



### Get quiz 1
GET http://localhost:8081/quiz/questions?amount=10&category=21&difficulty=easy
Authorization: Bearer {{user}}

### Get quiz 2
GET http://localhost:8081/quiz/questions?amount=5&category=10&difficulty=easy
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}



